---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Controls">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Action</th>
        <th>Control</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Pan</td>
        <td>Drag or arrow keys</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Zoom</td>
        <td>
          Scroll, pinch, <code>+</code>/<code>=</code>, or <code>-</code>{" "}
          (10%–500%)
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Fit graph</td>
        <td>
          <code>0</code> or <strong>Fit</strong>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Expand/collapse compound</td>
        <td>
          Click a collapsed body or <code>[+]</code>/<code>[−]</code>; at low
          zoom, click the expanded body
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Multiple selection</td>
        <td>Ctrl-click or Cmd-click; combines highlights</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Clear selection</td>
        <td>Click empty space</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Load another graph</td>
        <td>
          <strong>Load JSON</strong>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Stop loading</td>
        <td>
          <strong>Cancel loading</strong>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>
    Zoom stays anchored at the cursor or pinch midpoint. Click a node outside
    its compound toggle to highlight its ancestors, descendants, and edges
    between them, including collapsed scopes. Click an edge to highlight it and
    its endpoints. Other geometry dims. If loading fails, the picker shows an
    error.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
